    {
      "annotation": "Le plan de coupe au ras de la cavité sépare la boîte (corps _1) et le couvercle (corps _2).",
      "annotation_en": "The cutting plane flush with the cavity separates the box (body _1) and the lid (body _2).",
      "id": "9fdbf48c-65a8-4ac3-b252-ebbc54e2d186",
      "name": "Separation_couvercle",
      "params": {
        "body": "98fd12cf-e028-403b-879f-495cced7e8ac",
